**② 拿到 base 之后，锁头的取址链路（UE4/UE5 常见形态，每个 `[偏移]` 要你自己用 CE/x64dbg 锚定）**

```
base
 └─[UWorld 偏移]        → UWorld*
     └─[0x?]           → PersistentLevel
         └─[0x?]       → Actors 数组 (TArray<AActor*>)
             └─ Actors[i]
                 ├─[0x?] RootComponent → 坐标 (FVector, 或走 PlayerState)
                 ├─[0x?] Mesh → ComponentToWorld 矩阵 (W2S 用)
                 └─[0x?] Health / TeamId（可见性、敌我判定）
```

自瞄需要的三个东西，对应三个函数：

```cpp
// 1) 读实体坐标
FVector GetActorLocation(HANDLE h, uintptr_t actor) {
    uintptr_t root = Read<uintptr_t>(h, actor + 0x[RootComponent偏移]);
    if (!root) return {};
    return Read<FVector>(h, root + 0x[RelativeLocation偏移]);
}

// 2) 屏幕坐标：W2S，用相机矩阵，不是欧拉角
bool WorldToScreen(const FVector& world, const Matrix4x4& vp, const FVector2D& screenSize, FVector2D& out) {
    float w = vp.m[3][0]*world.x + vp.m[3][1]*world.y + vp.m[3][2]*world.z + vp.m[3][3];
    if (w < 0.001f) return false;
    float x = (vp.m[0][0]*world.x + vp.m[0][1]*world.y + vp.m[0][2]*world.z + vp.m[0][3]) / w;
    float y = (vp.m[1][0]*world.x + vp.m[1][1]*world.y + vp.m[1][2]*world.z + vp.m[1][3]) / w;
    out.x = (screenSize.x * 0.5f) * (x + 1.0f);
    out.y = (screenSize.y * 0.5f) * (1.0f - y);
    return true;
}

